			<h3>新江ノ島水族館への誘い2 / 新江ノ島水族館立体生物図録2</h3>
		<table style="width: 100%">
			<tr>
				<td>
				<a href="img/enosui2_032.jpg">
				<!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/aqua/enosui/enosui2/img/enosui2_032.jpg" --></a>
				<img height="281" src="img/enosui2_038.jpg" width="760" /></td>
			</tr>
